    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-IN2 — Inbound VAPI Event Router\n\nSingle webhook URL for ALL inbound VAPI events.\nMirrors WF2 but adds assistant-request routing and calls WF8.\n\n**Routing:**\n- `assistant-request` → WF8 Lead Lookup (sync, < 3s) → return { variables: {...} }\n- `tool-calls` → WF3 Tool Dispatcher (sync, < 5s) → return { results: [...] }\n- `end-of-call-report` → WF-IN4 Post-Call (async, fire+forget) → 200 OK\n- Everything else → 200 OK, ignored\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Activate this workflow\n2. Copy Production webhook URL from the Webhook node\n3. Paste into VAPI inbound assistant → Server URL\n\n**Upstream:** VAPI (all inbound assistant events)\n**Downstream:** WF8 (assistant-request), WF3 (tool-calls), WF-IN4 (end-of-call)",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "win2-sticky-overview",
      "name": "📋 WF-IN2 Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -416
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Tool-Calls Branch**\n\nVAPI needs response within 5 seconds.\nCalls WF3 synchronously, waits for completion.\nReturns `{ results: [...] }` directly to VAPI.\n\n**Error handling:** If WF3 crashes, Handle WF3 Response builds a graceful fallback using original toolCallIds. VAPI never times out silently.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "win2-sticky-tools",
      "name": "📞 Tool-Calls Branch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        -288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Assistant-Request Branch**\n\nFires BEFORE the AI speaks on every inbound call.\nCalls WF8 synchronously (must complete < 3 seconds).\n\nWF8 looks up caller in Sheets and returns:\n`{ variables: { callerName, serviceInterest, isExistingLead, ... } }`\n\nVAPI injects these into the system prompt for personalized greeting.\n\n**Fallback:** If WF8 fails, returns empty variables — call proceeds with generic greeting.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "win2-sticky-assist",
      "name": "🎤 Assistant-Request Branch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        -528
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**End-of-Call Branch**\n\nFires WF-IN4 asynchronously — does NOT wait.\nResponds 200 OK to VAPI immediately.\n\nWF-IN4 handles: CRM update, Clients tab update,\nSMS confirmation, urgency alerts.\n\nInbound calls only. Outbound calls use WF4 via WF2.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "win2-sticky-eoc",
      "name": "📊 End-of-Call Branch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        -80
      ]
    },
